'''Spring for Sensei''' (新・春だよ！高校教師, ''Shin・Harudayo! Kōkō Kyōshi'', '''New・It's Spring! High School Teacher''') is the April [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsule G|Lucky Ticket G]] event in [[The Battle Cats]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. The enemy introduced in this event is [[Ms. Madonna]], a variant of [[Kang Roo]]. This event was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

==Event==
Is Maiden Cat's springtime crush destined to end only in heartbreak?!<br>
During this event, visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} and select the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Spring for Sensei'''}} map to confront the unflappable idol of the teacher's office, {{Color|#FF0000|'''Ms. Madonna'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available April 16th (11:00am) thru May 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Clear the stages to earn coveted "Lucky Tickets G"!<br>
Head to the normal capsule and choose the Lucky Capsules G mode to use your rewards and pick up tons of XP and valuable special items! Later stages in "Spring for Sensei" will have a higher drop rate for more ticket rewards at once!

※"Spring for Sensei" is available once Empire of Cats Ch 3 has been cleared.<br>
※If stages for this event do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Lucky Tickets G!'''}}<br>
Use rewards from "Spring for Sensei" to earn Catamins and XP packs from a new normal capsule option! Tap the button at the top of the Cat Capsules menu to select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules G'''}} option and draw using your {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets G!'''}}

※ If you own any Lucky Tickets G, the banner option to use them at the Cat Tickets menu will appear, whether an event that provides them is available or not.<br>
※ Collected Lucky Tickets G will not be lost even after the event you earned them from has ended.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules G option does not appear in the Cat Capsules, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

